  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build a Daycare Center for Young Learners in PH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sitio Bakal Community in Quezon City, Philippines is a very remote area with no proper and concrete road access which makes going to and from the school painstakingly difficult especially for the very young children. Everyday, these children had to endure a 30 to 45-minute walk. This project will complete the construction of a solar-powered Daycare Center in the Sitio Bakal Community providing access to Early Childhood Education for 50 young learners residing in the community.</narrative>
  </description>
